{"base":{"webm":"/voice/you-look-tired-base-ac42c5436839.webm","m4a":"/voice/you-look-tired-base-ac42c5436839.m4a","lines":{"alex|Morning… is it Friday yet?":[0,1752],"me|It's Monday. Nine in the morning.":[1902,2336],"alex|Ugh, I need more coffee.":[4388,1547],"me|You look so tired. You okay?":[6086,2720],"alex|Oh… do I look that bad?":[8955,2837],"me|Did you not sleep well last night?":[11943,1870],"alex|Uh, not really. Why?":[13963,2490],"me|Rough morning? Need some coffee?":[16603,2125],"alex|Yeah, stayed up fixing slides.":[18878,1966],"me|You don't look well. Are you sick?":[20994,2514],"alex|Wait, what? I feel fine…":[23658,3054]}},"followUp":{"webm":"/voice/you-look-tired-followUp-141cdc567298.webm","m4a":"/voice/you-look-tired-followUp-141cdc567298.m4a","lines":{"alex|Ran five kilometers before work!":[0,2718],"me|Wait, the same Alex from last month?":[2868,2749],"alex|New me. Zero energy drinks.":[5767,2816],"alex|So, can you tell a difference?":[8734,1115],"me|Whoa, you lost so much weight!":[9999,2558],"alex|Oh… thanks, I guess?":[12707,2240],"me|Whoa, you look so skinny now!":[15097,2183],"alex|Skinny…? Like, too thin?":[17430,2832],"me|Totally! You're glowing lately!":[20412,2314],"alex|Haha, five a.m. club pays off!":[22875,2499],"me|Whoa, your face got so small!":[25525,2601],"alex|My face… got smaller? Huh?":[28276,3715]}}}